<title>USA: Banco Wiese Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Banco Wiese Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS			  $0.18		    $0.16</p>
<p> Shr			   0.12		     0.10</p>
<p> Net			 28,564		   21,649</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company has 251,867,497 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Share and net figure in Peruvian soles. Per ADS figure is in dollars. $1.00 = 2.64 nuevos soles, as of March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Net income per ADS is equal to Net income per share multiplied by four.</p>
<p>Net interest income: 93.9 million nuevo soles vs 75.3 million nuevos soles.</p>
</text>
